### Get all workshop registrations
GET http://localhost:3000/api/workshop-registrations

### Get workshop registrations for a specific workshop
GET http://localhost:3000/api/workshop-registrations?workshop_id=36e29f3a-7641-4280-9f76-273371b2564e

### Create a new workshop registration
POST http://localhost:3000/api/workshop-registrations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "workshop_id": "36e29f3a-7641-4280-9f76-273371b2564e",
  "form_data": {
    "name": "John Doe",
    "email": "john.doe@example.com"
  }
}
